(5, 'products', 'Updated Product Premium Short Sleeve Cuban Collar Shirt - (Off black)', 'Modules\\Product\\Models\\Product', 2, 'App\\Models\\User', 1, '{\"new\": {\"updated_at\": \"2026-06-20 03:04:10\", \"long_description\": \"<p>Introducing our latest collection of men\'s premium &nbsp;cuban collar shirts, featuring the trendy and stylish Cuban collar print shirt. This short-sleeved, lightweight shirt is a perfect choice for casual wear or any party occasion. Its unique and personalized pattern will surely make you stand out in the crowd. The shirt is made with high-quality fabric that is breathable and comfortable to wear for long hours. Don\'t miss the chance to add this to your clothing collection and experience outstanding fashion and comfort like never before!</p>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li><strong>Product Name:</strong> Premium Short Sleeve Cuban Collar Shirt</li>\\r\\n<li><strong>Fabric Pattern:</strong> 100% Cotton</li>\\r\\n<li><strong>Fabric Type:</strong> Print</li>\\r\\n<li><strong>Color:</strong> Off black</li>\\r\\n</ul>\\r\\n<p>Y Fit/Slim fit collar shirt<br>Turn-down collar, classic button placket.</p>\\r\\n<p>Cash on delivery facility available.<br>Home delivery all over Bangladesh &ndash; 24&ndash;48 hours inside Dhaka &amp; 24&ndash;72 hours outside Dhaka.<br>Exchange facility &ndash; You can exchange if size or reject issue is issued within 7 days of delivery.</p>\\r\\n<p>[Note: The color of the product may vary slightly due to the lighting during photography or the display settings of your device.]</p>\"}, \"old\": {\"updated_at\": \"2026-06-19T19:59:35.000000Z\", \"long_description\": null}}', 'updated', '2026-06-19 21:04:10', '2026-06-19 21:04:10'),
