(90, 'products', 'Updated Product Premium Cotton Full Sleeve Formal Shirt - (Onion Pink)', 'Modules\\Product\\Models\\Product', 27, 'App\\Models\\User', 1, '{\"new\": {\"updated_at\": \"2026-06-20 16:32:06\", \"long_description\": \"<p>This premium formal shirt is made for the man who finds beauty in texture, subtlety and thoughtful layering. Crafted from premium plain fabric and geometric-pattern dobby contrast detailing, this shirt has a soft and natural feel that is both comfortable and stylish. Made from natural pure cotton, this is a shirt you will want to wear again and again. Be it for a smart-casual daytime event, or any occasion that calls for effortless and thoughtful style.</p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\r\\n<p><strong>Product Name:</strong> Premium Cotton Full Sleeve Formal Shirt</p>\\r\\n<p><strong>Fabric Type:</strong> Cotton</p>\\r\\n<p><strong>Fabric Pattern:</strong> Geometric-pattern</p>\\r\\n<p><strong>Color:</strong> Onion Pink</p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n<li>Cash on delivery facility available.</li>\\r\\n<li>Home delivery all over Bangladesh &ndash; 24&ndash;48 hours inside Dhaka &amp; 24&ndash;72 hours outside Dhaka.</li>\\r\\n<li>Exchange facility &ndash; You can exchange if a size or reject issue is issued within 7 days of delivery.</li>\\r\\n</ul>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\r\\n<p>[Note: The color of the product may vary slightly due to the lighting during photography or the display settings of your device.]</p>\"}, \"old\": {\"updated_at\": \"2026-06-20T10:19:20.000000Z\", \"long_description\": null}}', 'updated', '2026-06-20 10:32:06', '2026-06-20 10:32:06'),
