(1047, 'products', 'Updated Product Premium Imported Cotton Full Sleeve Shirt - (Sage Green)', 'Modules\\Product\\Models\\Product', 50, 'App\\Models\\User', 1, '{\"old\":{\"name\":\"Premium Imported Cotton Full Sleeve Shirt - (Sea Green) (Copy)\",\"slug\":\"premium-imported-cotton-full-sleeve-shirt-sea-green-copy\",\"cost_price\":\"725.00\",\"sell_price\":\"1450.00\",\"long_description\":\"<p>This premium casual shirt is made for the man who finds beauty in texture, subtlety and thoughtful layering. Crafted from premium imported fabric dobby contrast detailing, this shirt has a soft and natural feel that is both comfortable and stylish. Made from natural pure cotton, this is a shirt you will want to wear again and again. Be it for a smart-casual daytime event, or any occasion that calls for effortless and thoughtful style.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Product Name: Premium Imported Cotton Full Sleeve Shirt - (Sea Green)<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Fabric Type: Imported &nbsp;Cotton Febric<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Fabric Pattern: Print<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Color: Sea Green<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Cash on delivery facility available.<br>Home delivery all over Bangladesh &ndash; 24&ndash;48 hours inside Dhaka &amp; 24&ndash;72 hours outside Dhaka.<br>Exchange facility &ndash; You can exchange if a size or reject issue is issued within 7 days of delivery.<br>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>[Note: The color of the product may vary slightly due to the lighting during photography or the display settings of your device.]<\\/p>\",\"status\":\"draft\",\"thumbnail\":\"uploads\\/products\\/thumbnails\\/0bMKsbafS3ASysUbYWE0XU6QyvXOpobgrKFGPeD2.webp\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-07-15T11:57:41.000000Z\"},\"new\":{\"name\":\"Premium Imported Cotton Full Sleeve Shirt - (Sage Green)\",\"slug\":\"premium-imported-cotton-full-sleeve-shirt-sage-green\",\"cost_price\":\"675\",\"sell_price\":\"1350\",\"long_description\":\"<p>This premium casual shirt is made for the man who finds beauty in texture, subtlety and thoughtful layering. Crafted from premium imported fabric dobby contrast detailing, this shirt has a soft and natural feel that is both comfortable and stylish. Made from natural pure cotton, this is a shirt you will want to wear again and again. Be it for a smart-casual daytime event, or any occasion that calls for effortless and thoughtful style.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Product Name: Premium Imported Cotton Full Sleeve Shirt - (Sage Green)<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Fabric Type: Imported &nbsp;Cotton Febric<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Fabric Pattern: Print<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Color: Sage Green<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Cash on delivery facility available.<br>Home delivery all over Bangladesh &ndash; 24&ndash;48 hours inside Dhaka &amp; 24&ndash;72 hours outside Dhaka.<br>Exchange facility &ndash; You can exchange if a size or reject issue is issued within 7 days of delivery.<br>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>[Note: The color of the product may vary slightly due to the lighting during photography or the display settings of your device.]<\\/p>\",\"status\":\"inactive\",\"thumbnail\":\"uploads\\/products\\/thumbnails\\/TvPP10gpd7QQLbdi4Tz2KIiU7evHZY4ZDVfVImXe.webp\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-07-15 18:06:13\"}}', 'updated', '2026-07-15 22:06:13', '2026-07-15 22:06:13'),
