oth feel ideal for Bangladesh&rsquo;s warm summer days. Designed to boost your confidence and keep you effortlessly stylish, it&rsquo;s perfect for hanging out with friends or making a statement on social media.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Step into next-generation fashion with a polo shirt that&rsquo;s made for those who want to express their bold personality and enjoy all-day comfort.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><strong>Product Name:<\\/strong> Premium Quality Half Sleeve China Mercerized Polo-shirt<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><strong>Fabric Type:<\\/strong> China Mercerized Cotton<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><strong>Fabric Weight<\\/strong>: 160+ GSM<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><strong>Color: <\\/strong>Light Greyish-Green<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Cash on Delivery facility available.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Home delivery all over Bangladesh &ndash; 24-48 hours inside Dhaka and 24-72 hours outside Dhaka.<br>Product Exchange Facility &ndash; You can exchange the product within 7 days of delivery due to size or rejection issues.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>[Note: Product color may vary slightly due to lighting during photo shooting or your device\'s display settings.]<\\/p>\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-07-18 13:15:59\"}}', 'updated', '2026-07-18 17:15:59', '2026-07-18 17:15:59'),
